    {
      "id": "44069B78F99C2129",
      "title": "The Oathless",
      "description": [
        "Craft the reusable Oath Shard from iron, rotten flesh and amethyst (JEI shows its recipe). Stand outdoors, aim into open air and right-click it to summon The Oathless four blocks ahead.",
        "This is a custom husk champion, not a randomly generated Apotheosis elite. It has 50 health, armor and a sword. It cannot despawn.",
        "Only one can be summoned nearby at a time. The shard is reusable if you need to try again."
      ],
